CFG260 PRE-FLIGHT (mocks only; reads NO HI line width): what the BUDHIES primary set (outside 2 Mpc, M_HI >= 3e9) could say about the implied a0 at z ~ 0.2, and whether FLAT can be told from a0 ~ H(z).
Frozen criteria: FROZEN_CRITERIA.md (00f20121d) + Addendum 1 (2b8a8e4c7), committed before this script.  The real inputs are the non-width columns (z, D_L, M_HI, S_int, B, R, membership, R_proj); the widths are MOCK.
The loader (cfg260_core.load_galaxies) cannot return a width unless widths=True, which only the measurement script passes.  kappa = 1/2 FITTED; no sentence says the data favour a law.

  mode: main

